helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	hd_id3150869	5			0	da	Formelcelle				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\06040000.xhp	0	help	par_id3153194	6			0	da	\<ahelp hid=\"SC:EDIT:RID_SCDLG_SOLVER:ED_FORMULACELL\"\>I formelcellen indtastes referencen til den celle, der indeholder formlen. Den indeholder den aktuelle cellereference.\</ahelp\> Klik i en anden celle i arket for at anvende dens reference i tekstfeltet.				20130618 17:22:18
