helpcontent2	source\text\shared\01\online_update_dialog.xhp	0	help	par_id8277230				0	da	\<ahelp hid=\".\" visibility=\"hidden\"\>Installerer den overførte opdatering.\</ahelp\>				20130618 17:22:18
